<title>RUSSIA: Russian average wage rises one pct in August.</title>
<headline>Russian average wage rises one pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian average wages rose one percent in August to 850,000 roubles, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN AVERAGE WAGES	AUG 96	JUL 96	AUG 95</p>
<p>    average wage		  850,000     842,800     520,600</p>
<p>    subsistence income	  369,000     384,000     286,000</p>
<p>NOTES - Average wage and subsistence income in roubles. In August, 20 percent of the population or 29.5 million people were receiving less than subsistence income.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
